1
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:01,960
亲爱的
Hey, honey.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,800
正好赶上吃早饭了
Oh, you're just in time for breakfast.

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,220
我们也许应该少吃点
Ooh, we should probably go light on the food.

4
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:06,800
直觉告诉我
Something tells me we're

5
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,320
撑着肚子去会不舒服的
not gonna want to do this on a full stomach.

6
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,880
不敢相信居然真的有尸检夏令营这种东西
I can't believe there's such a thing as autopsy camp.

7
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:14,020
根本没什么尸检夏令营
There is no such thing as autopsy camp.

8
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,180
我不得不骗卢克
I had to trick Luke

9
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:17,761
因为我其实是要带他去上交谊舞课
'cause I'm actually taking him to a ballroom-dance class.

10
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:18,640
他一直很抗拒
He's been resisting,

11
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,440
但他流淌着舞蹈家的血液
but it's in his blood.

12
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:21,790
我们邓菲家族舞蹈家辈出
I come from a long line of dancing Dunphys --

13
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:23,120
其实都是啦啦队的
A kick line, actually.

14
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:27,080
快点 我们可别晚了[救不活]
Come on, we don't want to be late,

15
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,460
像那个我们将看到的解剖台上的家伙
like the guy we're gonna see on the table.

16
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:29,040
我说得没错吧
Am I right?

17
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,804
确"尸"没错
Of corpse you are.

18
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:31,860
老妈 你能带我去练车吗
Hey, mom, can you take me driving?

19
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,720
我快考试了 我真的得好好练练
My test is coming up, and I really need to practice.

20
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,200
亲爱的 我也想
Oh, honey, I would,

21
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,340
但我今天有个很重要的
but I've got a big

22
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:38,560
橱柜和百叶窗协会会议
closets and blinds union meeting today.

23
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,900
根本没什么橱柜和百叶窗协会
There is no closets and blinds union.

24
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,580
跟艾丽克斯一起开车绝对是种折磨
Driving with Alex is torture.

25
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:43,900
她开得太慢了
She drives so slowly.

26
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,340
全世界可能只有我这个家长
I have to be the only parent

27
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,160
需要狂踩假想的油门
who slams on the imaginary gas.

28
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,040
我没什么事 可以带她练车
Hey, I'm not doing anything. I guess I could take her.

29
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,920
太棒了 我去检查胎压和油液位
Great! I'll go check the tire pressure and the fluid levels!

30
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,462
有意思 迫不及待了
Fun! Can't wait!

31
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:54,200
我马上就来
Be out in a sec!

32
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:56,340
好了 我提价了
Okay, my rate just went up.

33
00:00:56,340 --> 00:00:58,640
好 但这钱既是酬劳也是封口费
All right, but this buys your time and your silence.

34
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:01,500
不能让艾丽克斯知道我有多讨厌陪她练车
Alex can never know how much I hate driving with her.

35
00:01:02,857 --> 00:01:04,760
她今天倒是很急啊
Mm, she's in a hurry today.

36
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:06,820
那只是她九步安全测试的第一步
Oh, that's just step one of her nine-point safety test.

37
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:08,220
第二步是检查喇叭
Step two is checking the horn

38
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:10,100
确保检查喇叭没有搞坏喇叭
to make sure checking the horn didn't break the horn.

39
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:12,460
她就不该开车
She should never drive.

40
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:28,320
别想了 你耍了我
Forget it! You tricked me!

41
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:30,060
很抱歉 伙计 但我的儿子
I'm sorry, buddy, but no son of mine's

42
00:01:30,060 --> 00:01:31,560
可不能上了高中都不知道
going to high school without at least knowing

43
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,960
怎么跳方形步
how to do a proper box step.

44
00:01:33,580 --> 00:01:35,360
相信我 会跳舞的人总能钓到妹子
Trust me, dancers always get the girls.

45
00:01:35,460 --> 00:01:36,740
还记得《浑身是劲》里那个
Remember the great Kevin Bacon

46
00:01:36,740 --> 00:01:37,580
很厉害的凯文·培根吗
from "Footloose"?

47
00:01:37,780 --> 00:01:39,240
我看是"浑身傻劲"吧
More like "Footloser."

48
00:01:39,380 --> 00:01:39,780
注意点
Careful!

49
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:43,420
好了 废话少说 必须去学
All right, no more talking. We're doing this.

50
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:46,200
有一天你会感激我的
You'll thank me someday.

51
00:01:46,260 --> 00:01:48,720
等你找到自己的标志性舞步后就好多了
It gets better when you find your signature move!

52
00:01:48,860 --> 00:01:50,620
他们以前总叫我"下腰之王"[扒手之王]
They used to call me "King of the dips"!

53
00:01:53,580 --> 00:01:55,960
昨晚曼尼的派对剩下的东西
Why can't we just repurpose some of the stuff

54
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:57,200
怎么不能重复利用呢
from manny's party last night?

55
00:01:57,380 --> 00:01:58,580
我们还剩半个蛋糕
We got half a cake left.

56
00:01:58,860 --> 00:02:00,120
气球都完好无损
The balloons are fine.

57
00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:02,220
我的两个儿子
It's bad enough that both my sons

58
00:02:02,220 --> 00:02:03,560
同一天生日已经够糟了
have to share the same birthday.

59
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,680
他们至少得有自己的生日派对吧
At least they deserve their own party.

60
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,528
你觉得乔会介意吃昨天的蛋糕吗
You think Joe's gonna mind day-old cake?

61
00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:09,000
他都吃不了 才长了三颗牙
He can't even eat it. He's got three teeth.

62
00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:10,740
20年后你想吃蛋糕的时候
I'll remember that in 20 years

63
00:02:10,740 --> 00:02:11,480
我一定不会忘了这话
when you want cake.

64
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:13,520
他都不知道派对是为他举办的
He doesn't even know the party's for him.

65
00:02:13,791 --> 00:02:15,440
他懂的比你想象的多
He understands more than you think.

66
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:16,020
是吧 安迪
Right, Andy?

67
00:02:16,020 --> 00:02:19,578
谁 乔老弟吗 他聪明得很
Who, F-Jo here? He is smart as a whip.

68
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:22,760
我们玩躲猫猫 他一半时候比我快
When we play peek-a-boo, half the time he's ahead of me.

69
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,900
又不是《诸神之战》
Not exactly "Clash of the Titans."

70
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,680
曼尼 那是谁的外套
Manny, whose coat is that?

71
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:29,400
昨晚派对结束后艾米·马丁落在这儿的
Amy Martin left it here last night after my party.

72
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:31,760
我昨晚收到了她发出的强烈信号
I was getting some pretty strong signals from her.

73
00:02:31,940 --> 00:02:33,160
我觉得她是故意落下的
I think she did it on purpose

74
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:34,680
这样她就有借口再回来
so she'd have an excuse to come back.

75
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:37,620
又或者是因为她恨不得尽早脱身
Or because she couldn't get out fast enough.

76
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:38,640
如果她是卡通人物
If she was a cartoon,

77
00:02:38,660 --> 00:02:39,740
早就把她的皮囊留在这儿跑路了
she'd have left her skin here.

78
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:40,900
这话什么意思
What does that mean?

79
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:43,340
意思是他高攀不上艾米
That Amy is out of his league.

80
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:45,840
他总是这样 最终以受伤收场
He always does this and ends up getting hurt.

81
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,660
-你得跟他谈谈 -该说什么
- You need to talk to him. - And say what?

82
00:02:47,660 --> 00:02:49,840
告诉他追他有机会追到的女孩
Tell him to go for girls he stands a chance with.

83
00:02:50,127 --> 00:02:51,760
我偷听到了他跟罗本的谈话
I overheard him talking to Reuben.

84
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:53,180
有个女孩真的很喜欢他
There's some girl that really likes him,

85
00:02:53,180 --> 00:02:54,760
但曼尼对人家没兴趣
but of course Manny's not interested in her.

86
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,340
他非要追啦啦队长
He's got to go for the head cheerleader.

87
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,860
你怎么知道艾米是啦啦队长
How do you know that Amy's the head cheerleader?

88
00:02:57,860 --> 00:02:59,600
这也是我偷听到的
I overheard that, too.

89
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:01,760
你这个看电影时经常要问
For someone whose favorite words at the movies

90
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:02,980
"他刚刚说什么"的人
are, "What did he say?"

91
00:03:02,980 --> 00:03:04,774
倒是偷听得很清楚啊
you overhear pretty good.

92
00:03:08,292 --> 00:03:09,750
没错 莉莉 我拉钩发誓
Yes, Lily, I-I pinky-promise

93
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:11,380
我们会赶回家参加乔的生日派对
that we'll be home in time for baby Joe's party.

94
00:03:12,660 --> 00:03:14,020
是啊 我在跟手机拉钩啦
I am. I'm touching to the phone.

95
00:03:14,860 --> 00:03:16,540
是啊 还有蝴蝶之吻[用睫毛刷对方脸颊]
Yeah, and butterfly kisses.

96
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,180
好了 好了
Okay, okay.

97
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,840
小女孩 容易激动
Little girls -- so excitable.

98
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:24,700
我正期望能有个露台 结果他们真的有
I was wishing they had a gazebo, and then they did!

99
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,900
我从小时候起就在梦想着
Ever since I was a little boy, I have dreamed --

100
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:30,980
梦想着在这样一个地方结婚
dreamed of getting married in a place exactly like this.

101
00:03:31,100 --> 00:03:32,200
你们想在什么日子举行婚礼
So, what date were you looking at?

102
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:33,000
3月28日
March 28th.

103
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,540
那是我们第一次约会的纪念日
That's the anniversary of our first date.

104
00:03:34,540 --> 00:03:38,160
等等 抱歉 请问这是每人的价格吗
Oh, wait, um, I'm sorry. Is this price per person?

105
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:39,960
是的 不包括酒水 蛋糕和伴奏
Yes, excluding alcohol, cake, and music.

106
00:03:40,140 --> 00:03:41,320
这是什么 门诺派教徒套餐吗
What's that -- the Mennonite package?

107
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:43,700
你会发现我们的价格是很有竞争力的
I think you'll find our prices are competitive.

108
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:45,120
我已经准备好签字了
Well, I'm ready to commit.

109
00:03:45,540 --> 00:03:46,540
小卡 小卡
Cam, Cam.

110
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:48,380
抱歉
I'm sorry.

111
00:03:48,380 --> 00:03:50,052
能 能等我们一会儿吗
Can -- can we have a moment, please?

112
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:53,900
好 但愿他不是到了最后时刻想悔婚
Okay, well, let's hope he's not having any last-minute jitters.

113
00:03:55,020 --> 00:03:56,660
你不是要在最后时刻悔婚吧
You're not having last-minute jitters, are you?

114
00:03:56,740 --> 00:03:58,840
不 不 但那真是一大笔钱
No, no, but it's a really large deposit,

115
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,340
我想确定一下
and I want to make sure

116
00:03:59,340 --> 00:04:00,820
我们是否真的选定这个地方了
that we're absolutely certain about this place.

117
00:04:00,940 --> 00:04:01,560
我很确定
Well, I'm certain,

118
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:03,120
所有可行的地方我们都看过了
and we've looked at every possible venue.

119
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,940
而且目前胡娇对这里的点评
And Pepper was by far the least snarky

120
00:04:04,940 --> 00:04:05,640
是最不尖酸的了
about this one.

121
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:06,460
那倒是
That's true.

122
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:08,260
他是不会轻易说出"还行"这种字眼的
He doesn't throw the word "Adequate" around lightly.

123
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:10,730
-好的 就定这里了 -好的
- Okay, okay, it's this place. - Okay.

124
00:04:10,730 --> 00:04:12,260
但是不要表现得这么兴奋好吗
But stop being so excited, all right?

125
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:13,780
我们或许还能杀杀价
We might be able to get the price down a little bit.

126
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:15,674
好的 好的 冷面无情 冷面无情
Okay, okay, poker face, poker face.

127
00:04:15,674 --> 00:04:17,938
-现在把语气情绪去掉 -冷语无情
- Yeah, now work on your poker voice. - Poker voice.

128
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:20,440
好的 我们确实喜欢这里
So, we do like it.

129
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,160
但还算不上钟爱
We're just not sure that we love it.

130
00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:23,220
是 还不算钟爱
Yeah, we're not sure we love it.

131
00:04:23,420 --> 00:04:24,200
那真让我松口气
Oh, that's a relief

132
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,600
因为刚有人打来电话
because someone just called.

133
00:04:25,620 --> 00:04:26,540
-那个房间已经订出去了 -什么
- The room is booked. - What?!

134
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:27,780
不不不 等等
No, no, no! Okay, wait,

135
00:04:27,780 --> 00:04:28,400
你是要采取强硬手段吗
are you playing hardball?

136
00:04:28,460 --> 00:04:29,700
因为我们这是在采取强硬手段
Because we're playing hardball, too!

137
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:31,360
我们爱死这里了
We love it!

138
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,100
对不起
Oh, s-sorry.

139
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:33,820
有位打算庆祝16岁生日的女孩
A young lady planning a sweet 16

140
00:04:33,820 --> 00:04:34,820
刚刚订下了你们的日期
just booked your date.

141
00:04:34,820 --> 00:04:37,420
下一个可预订日期还要等上...
After that, we don't have another opening for...

142
00:04:37,980 --> 00:04:39,480
-两个月 -不
- two months. - No.

143
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:41,240
不 必须是我们周年纪念日那天
No, it has to be on our anniversary.

144
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:42,840
等等 那房间是特蕾西·麦考伊订的吗
Wait, did Tracy Mccoy book this room?

145
00:04:43,500 --> 00:04:45,180
特蕾西·麦考伊是我的学生
Tracy Mccoy's a student of mine.

146
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:47,260
好 我可能有个计划
Okay, I may have a plan.

147
00:04:47,260 --> 00:04:49,880
我绝不接受把婚礼和"饥饿游戏"主题的
I am not having a wedding/"Hunger games"-themed

148
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:50,760
甜蜜16岁派对搞在一起
sweet 16 par--

149
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,320
你在敲手指头
oh, you're tapping your fingers.

150
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:53,520
你还真有计划了
You really do have a plan.

151
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:57,360
某人闻起来很香啊
Well, somebody smells good.

152
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:58,700
那是什么香水
What perfume is that?

153
00:04:58,980 --> 00:04:59,800
各种香水都有
Every perfume!

154
00:05:00,020 --> 00:05:01,840
上帝只造出了20个浑身臭汗
20 of the sweatiest, geekiest girls

155
00:05:01,850 --> 00:05:03,580
古怪至极的女生用来污染地球
God ever fouled this planet with

156
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:05,600
而我一个汉子和她们每一个跳了舞
and just me dancing with all of them!

157
00:05:05,780 --> 00:05:06,640
跳摇摆舞的时候
During the charleston,

158
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:08,520
我的头发还缠在了一个女生的牙套上
my hair got caught in one of their headgear!

159
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,600
第一次上课就跳摇摆舞啦
Wow, Charleston on the first day?

160
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:11,780
这是最后一次
Last day!

161
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:13,140
不能因为你会跳舞
Just because you're a dancer

162
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:15,360
就非得让我也去跳舞 恰恰恰
doesn't mean I have to be one, too, cha cha cha.

163
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:16,400
该死
Damn it!

164
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:18,720
我再也不会被你的谎话欺骗了
I'm never gonna fall for one of your lies again.

165
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,680
快带我去参加尸检夏令营
Just take me to autopsy camp.

166
00:05:21,922 --> 00:05:25,009
糟糕 我该不会是要接罚单了吧
Oh, shoot. Am I gonna get a ticket?

167
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:26,220
要是世间有正气
If there's any justice,

168
00:05:26,220 --> 00:05:28,420
应该让你接上一二三四张
it'll be a big one, two, three, and four.

169
00:05:28,420 --> 00:05:29,400
该死
Damn it!

170
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:32,200
请出示驾驶证和汽车行驶证 谢谢
License and registration, please.

171
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,640
好的 给你
Absolutely. There you are.

172
00:05:33,938 --> 00:05:35,171
你知道你有个尾灯坏了吗
You know one of your taillights is out?

173
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:37,020
不 我没注意 真是不小心啊
No, I did not. What a ding-dong!

174
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:38,840
在这里等着
Wait right here.

175
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,885
好的 我们就在这里等着
Will do. We'll be right here.

176
00:05:41,420 --> 00:05:43,020
这是你对我说谎的惩罚
This is what you get for lying to me.

177
00:05:43,220 --> 00:05:45,240
我有什么办法 我以前说什么你都接受
What choice did I have? You used to be up for anything.

178
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:47,360
现在不管我提出什么建议 你都反对
Now, no matter what I suggest, it's no, no, no.

179
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:49,680
这就叫长大成人 有自己的兴趣爱好
It's called growing up and having your own interests,

180
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:50,940
像你爱看的《浑身是劲》里
like the minister's daughter

181
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:52,520
那个大臣之女一样
in your precious "Footloose."

182
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:54,740
竟然用我爱看的电影来驳斥我
Wow, using my own movie against me.

183
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,340
来给这孩子鼓鼓掌吧
Let's hear it for the boy.

184
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:58,580
请下车
Please step out of the car.

185
00:05:58,580 --> 00:06:00,300
我相信汽车尾灯坏了 不用下车看
Oh, I believe you about the taillight.

186
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,580
-下车 -好吧
- Out of the car! - Okay.

187
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,980
抱歉 但我得逮捕你
I'm sorry, but I have to place you under arrest.

188
00:06:04,580 --> 00:06:05,300
等等 你说什么
Wait, what?!

189
00:06:05,980 --> 00:06:07,200
你名下有一辆汽车
A car registered to you

190
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:09,520
累计有18次违规停车未付罚金
has accumulated 18 unpaid parking violations...

191
00:06:09,820 --> 00:06:11,000
都是占用校内车道
all on campus drive.

192
00:06:11,020 --> 00:06:12,680
我的天 那都是我女儿的罚单
Oh, my god, those are my daughter's tickets!

193
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,540
他为一切负责
He's got an answer for everything.

194
00:06:14,620 --> 00:06:16,040
我得把你带到局里去
I got to take you down to the station house.

195
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,140
你可以坐在副驾驶
You can ride up front with me.

196
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:18,840
说真的 我不能直接把罚款交给你吗
Seriously, can't I just pay you for them now?!

197
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:19,900
先生 你得去局里交
At the station house, sir.

198
00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:22,020
我们可以至少绕开中土漫画店
Can we at least not drive by middle earth comics

199
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:22,900
和蹦床世界吗
and trampoline world?!

200
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,840
这里的人民是很敬仰我的
People look up to me in this town!

201
00:06:34,700 --> 00:06:35,960
不 亲爱的 卢克没事
No, honey, Luke's fine.

202
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,760
他们不接受信用卡吗
And they won't take a credit card?

203
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,960
不接受 1600元 只收现金
No, it's $1,600, cash only.

204
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,100
可是 亲爱的 今天是周日
But, honey, it's Sunday.

205
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:43,000
我在自动提款机上只能提几百块钱
I can only get a few hundred bucks from the ATM.

206
00:06:43,220 --> 00:06:44,660
先生 您的通话时间到了
Sir, your time's up.

207
00:06:44,660 --> 00:06:46,928
亲爱的 使用应急现金吧
Honey, just use the emergency cash, okay?

208
00:06:46,928 --> 00:06:48,698
-时间到 -可是 菲尔
- Tick-Tock. -Uh, b-but, Phil --

209
00:06:48,698 --> 00:06:49,920
-我得挂了 -不 亲爱的
- Got to go! - No, honey --

210
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,180
藏钱的地方我忘了 菲尔
I forgot the hiding place! Phil?

211
00:06:52,500 --> 00:06:55,020
菲尔在家里藏了一千块钱
Phil has $1,000 hidden in the house,

212
00:06:55,020 --> 00:06:57,280
他还编了一套疯狂的助记法
and he's made up a crazy mnemonic device

213
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:58,440
用于记住藏钱的地点
to remember the location,

214
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:01,360
他每个月都会变换藏钱的地点来防备坏人
which he changes every month to stay ahead of the bad guys.

215
00:07:03,700 --> 00:07:04,580
哪有什么坏人
What bad guys?

216
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:07,220
搜刮的刮和傻瓜的瓜音似
"Loot" rhymes with "Coot,"

217
00:07:07,300 --> 00:07:08,920
会把我们带到
which takes us to...

218
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,600
你祖父的这张照片
this picture of your grandfather.

219
00:07:11,935 --> 00:07:14,680
钞票的票比较像飘飘的飘
"Moola" sounds like "Coola."

220
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,320
这算个词吗
Not a word.

221
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:17,920
钱就藏在空调的通风口
Money is in the air-conditioning vent.

222
00:07:21,860 --> 00:07:23,180
这件事马上就能解决了 伙计
This will all be over soon, buddy.

223
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:24,600
最后再给我笑一个
Just give me one last smile!

224
00:07:24,860 --> 00:07:25,440
你也笑一个
You too.

225
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:27,800
你妈已经带着钱上路了 别担心
Mom's already on her way with the money, okay? Don't worry!

226
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,680
上帝啊 我不想进那里
Oh, my god, I don't want to go in there!

227
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,600
你要进的是这里
You're going in here.

228
00:07:30,660 --> 00:07:31,860
我也不想进这里
I don't want to go in here!

229
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,720
好了 这是索菲工作的地方
Okay. This is where Sophie works.

230
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:35,880
她是戴帽子的那个女孩儿
She's the one in the hat.

231
00:07:35,940 --> 00:07:37,260
-明白 -特蕾西在楼上工作
- Copy that. - Tracy works upstairs.

232
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,280
我们半小时后美食街见 怎么样
We'll meet in the food court in 30 minutes. Sound like a plan?

233
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,600
还行 不确定是敲着手指想出来的计划
A plan, not sure if it's a finger-drumming plan.

234
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:42,260
快过去吧
Get in there.

235
00:07:42,740 --> 00:07:45,580
我的两个学生 特蕾西和索菲是闺蜜
Two of my students, Tracy and Sophie, BFFs,

236
00:07:45,740 --> 00:07:48,540
原本计划一起举办甜蜜16岁生日派对
were planning on having a joint sweet 16 together

237
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:51,460
但她们为了一个叫罗德尼的男生争风吃醋
until they got in a fight over a boy, Rodney.

238
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:54,800
现在特蕾西计划在马车房
Now Tracy is planning on having her own party

239
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,000
举办她自己的派对
at the carriage house.

240
00:07:56,100 --> 00:07:57,360
那是我们的位置 我们的日子
Our venue, our date.

241
00:07:57,540 --> 00:08:00,820
所以我们的办法是跟两人谈话让她们和好
So, our solution -- talk to them, patch things up

242
00:08:00,820 --> 00:08:02,520
这样她们就能在原定地点
so that they have their party together again

243
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:03,720
一起办派对了
at the original location.

244
00:08:04,060 --> 00:08:05,120
朋友间为了男孩子争风吃醋
Friends fighting over a boy --

245
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:06,560
对付这种事我们还是略知一二的
something we know a thing or two about.

246
00:08:06,740 --> 00:08:09,020
当然通常都是男同志们 而不是少女们
Of course, usually it's gay men, not teenage girls,

247
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:11,580
所以我们对策略的改变是 丝毫不变
so we will have to adjust our approach just a -- not at all.

248
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,640
我不知道
I don't know.

249
00:08:15,820 --> 00:08:17,180
需要帮忙吗
Uh, may I help you?

250
00:08:17,191 --> 00:08:19,340
是的 索菲
Mm, yeah, uh, Sophie.

251
00:08:19,340 --> 00:08:21,440
我想给我侄女买点儿东西
Um, I'm looking for something for my niece.

252
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,920
她最近很不开心
She's been really bummed out lately --

253
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:25,020
跟最好的朋友吵架了 所以我
fight with her best friend -- so I'm just --

254
00:08:25,020 --> 00:08:26,520
我想让她高兴起来
I'm trying to cheer her up.

255
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:27,220
你真好
That's so nice.

256
00:08:27,220 --> 00:08:28,140
是啊 她总跟我说
Yeah, she's always saying to me,

257
00:08:28,300 --> 00:08:30,560
米奇叔叔 你真酷 又那么时髦
"Uncle Mitch, you're so cool. You're so rad.

258
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,440
我真喜欢跟你讨论我的问题
I'm so glad I talk to you about my problems."

259
00:08:32,620 --> 00:08:34,960
我就是很了解那个年纪的孩子
You know, I just -- I really get kids that age.

260
00:08:34,970 --> 00:08:37,520
她 她快到16岁了
You know, she's -- she's almost 16, so...

261
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,780
我也快到16岁了
I'm almost 16.

262
00:08:39,060 --> 00:08:39,500
太巧了
Crazy.

263
00:08:42,180 --> 00:08:42,620
特蕾西
Tracy?

264
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:44,680
特蕾西·麦考伊
Tracy McCoy?

265
00:08:45,060 --> 00:08:46,580
塔克老师 你好啊
Mr. Tucker, hi.

266
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:48,660
我都不知道你已经到了可以工作的年龄了
I didn't know you were old enough to have a job.

267
00:08:48,660 --> 00:08:50,420
我直到16岁才有了份工作
I didn't have a job until I was 16.

268
00:08:50,432 --> 00:08:52,640
我就快到16岁了
Well, I'm almost 16, so...

269
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:53,120
真的啊
Crazy!

270
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:55,540
我的天啊 我还记得那个时候
Oh, my gosh, I remember back then.

271
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,160
我和我的朋友们过得特别开心
My friends and I had so much fun,

272
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,540
如果我们没有为了一些愚蠢的事情
well, when we weren't arguing

273
00:08:58,540 --> 00:09:01,606
争吵的话 比如派对还有...
about silly things like parties and...

274
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:08,620
行了 镜子看得够多了
Okay, that's a lot of mirror looking,

275
00:09:08,620 --> 00:09:10,340
我这么爱照镜子的人都嫌多
and that's me saying that.

276
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:12,880
很好 很好
Good, good.

277
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:14,380
这巡航速度真不错
Nice cruising speed.

278
00:09:14,500 --> 00:09:15,800
看啊 那有个慢跑的人
Oh, look, there's that jogger.

279
00:09:15,900 --> 00:09:16,780
我们现在在领跑呢
Now we're in the lead.

280
00:09:16,780 --> 00:09:19,100
讽刺挖苦这件事上你能踩下刹车吗
Can we put the brakes on the sarcasm?

281
00:09:19,460 --> 00:09:20,120
刹车早被踩坏了
They're worn out.

282
00:09:21,660 --> 00:09:22,240
喂 妈
Hey, mom.

283
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:23,660
海莉 你给我听着
Haley, listen to me.

284
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:26,180
因为你有一堆停车罚单没按时交罚款
You did not pay a bunch of parking tickets,

285
00:09:26,180 --> 00:09:28,140
你爸现在进监狱了
and now your father is in jail.

286
00:09:28,180 --> 00:09:29,640
而我得去把他保释出来
And I have to go bail him out

287
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:33,000
但我得先找到一大笔现金
just as soon as I can get my hands on a giant pile of cash.

288
00:09:34,060 --> 00:09:35,620
现金 灰烬
Cash -- ash!

289
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,400
天啊
Oh! Oh, god.

290
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:39,860
好多绒毛
Oh! That was furry!

291
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,380
你惹上大麻烦了
You are in so much trouble.

292
00:09:42,380 --> 00:09:43,501
你觉得我不知道吗
Oh, don't you think I know that?!

293
00:09:43,501 --> 00:09:44,560
我该怎么办
What am I gonna do?!

294
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:45,960
你会得到应有的惩罚
You're going to get what you deserve.

295
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:49,600
停车违规仅次于行车违规
A parking violation is second only to a moving violation,

296
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:51,760
行车违规会被剥夺驾驶特权
which is grounds for the loss of a driving privilege.

297
00:09:52,140 --> 00:09:53,400
是特权 不是普通权利
Privilege, not a right.

298
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:54,680
天啊 你闭嘴吧
Oh, my god, shut up!

299
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:56,500
这就是为什么妈付我钱给你做陪驾
This is why mom pays me to drive with you!

300
00:09:56,740 --> 00:09:57,020
什么
What?

301
00:09:57,140 --> 00:09:58,660
你以为她是从哪里打来的电话
Where do you think she's calling me from --

302
00:09:58,660 --> 00:10:00,000
衣柜和盲人协会吗
the closet and blinds union?

303
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:01,960
造衣柜的工人和盲人怎么会
Why would closet workers and blind people

304
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,160
在一起办协会
even have a union together?!

305
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:03,800
用脑子想想吧
Think!

306
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:07,580
打扰一下 服务生
Excuse me, waiter.

307
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:09,740
能给我介绍一下海鲜牛排套餐吗
Could you please tell me about the surf and turf?

308
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,280
龙虾先生说
Mr. Lobster says...

309
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:12,880
特别难吃
"It's terrible!"

310
00:10:12,981 --> 00:10:14,692
而牛说
While Mr. Cow goes...

311
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:17,760
我觉得你还是吃意大利面吧
"I think you should probably just have the pasta."

312
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:18,500
爸爸
Dada.

313
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:21,060
不 不 不对 宝宝
No, no, no, little man.

314
00:10:21,071 --> 00:10:23,760
在那里喝小酒的才是你爸爸
That's your dada right there with the drinky.

315
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:24,840
解释过多
Over-explaining.

316
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:27,320
别难过 他只是在发声
Don't feel bad. He's just making sounds.

317
00:10:27,500 --> 00:10:29,140
他可能都不知道"爸"字是什么意思
He may not even know what the "D" word means.

318
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:30,720
我没事 他才1岁
I'm fine. He's 1.

319
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:33,240
我见过他尿到自己的照片上还在笑
I've watched him pee into his own face and smile.

320
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:37,600
你好啊 亲爱的
Hola, mi amor.

321
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:39,360
我想跟你聊聊
I wanted to talk to you.

322
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:40,240
你在干什么
What are you doing?

323
00:10:40,580 --> 00:10:43,340
我打算用我自己的浪漫招数
I decided to top Amy's little "Forgotten Coat" trick

324
00:10:43,340 --> 00:10:44,840
给艾米忘记外套的小花招锦上添花
with a romantic gesture of my own.

325
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:45,760
你看
You see --

326
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:47,380
是的 关于艾米
Yes, about Amy...

327
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,800
我知道我不了解她
I know that I don't know her,

328
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:53,540
可她看起来就像你以前喜欢过的那些女孩
But she seems like some of those girls that you have liked,

329
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:54,640
可她们基本没有
but they haven't always--

330
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:56,420
你可能不了解她 但我很了解
You may not know her, but I do.

331
00:10:56,660 --> 00:10:58,080
我去看了她的Facebook页面
I went on her Facebook page,

332
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,520
然后在她大衣的每个口袋里
and I put one of her favorite things

333
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:00,840
都放了一样她喜欢的东西
in each of the pockets of her coat.

334
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:02,660
所以当她摸到里面时
So when she reaches inside--

335
00:11:02,660 --> 00:11:05,000
就会发现一小盒荷兰巧克力
she'll find a small box of Dutch chocolates.

336
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:05,980
很窝心 可是
Sweet, but --

337
00:11:05,980 --> 00:11:08,020
覆盆子狂想曲唇彩 有人想要吗
Raspberry rhapsody lip gloss, anyone?

338
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:10,200
我的最爱啊 可我还是觉得
My favorite, but I still wonder--

339
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:12,400
快看 天堂美浴浴盐
Hello, heavenly soak bath salts.

340
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,880
她还会发现什么
What next will she find?!

341
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:16,620
不过是一支山谷百合幽香烛台
Only a lily of the valley scented candle.

342
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:18,200
我的大爱
I love it!

343
00:11:18,376 --> 00:11:21,429
真希望她口袋再多点
Oh, I wish she had more pockets!

344
00:11:22,412 --> 00:11:25,000
"美元"跟"臭"音近
"Bucks" rhymes with "Nyuks" --

345
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,140
《三个臭皮匠》
Three Stooges.

346
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:28,740
混蛋
Damn it!

347
00:11:29,002 --> 00:11:32,108
"皮夹子" "塑料丝球"
"Wampum," "Pom-pom" --

348
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,900
啦啦队服
Cheerleading costume.

349
00:11:34,260 --> 00:11:36,360
拜托 天呐 真的要这么难么
Come on. Oh, my god, really?

350
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:38,560
"银行" "沉船"
"Bank," "Sank" --

351
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:42,280
《泰坦尼克号》电影的小说版
Novelization of the movie "Titanic."

352
00:11:42,820 --> 00:11:44,340
那我们为什么还要留着这东西
Then why do we keep that thing?!

353
00:11:45,140 --> 00:11:47,240
菲尔 当然了
Oh, Phil, of course!

354
00:11:47,580 --> 00:11:50,120
显然是因为"钱"音近于...
Of course, because "Dough" rhymes with--

355
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:50,380
管它呢
I don't care.

356
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:51,620
管它呢
I don't care.

357
00:11:57,640 --> 00:11:58,840
你好啊 小家伙
Hi, buddy.

358
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,660
我是谁
Who am I?

359
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:04,180
我是谁
Who am I?

360
00:12:04,180 --> 00:12:06,180
来吧
Come on.

361
00:12:07,740 --> 00:12:08,920
他是你爸爸
He's your dad.

362
00:12:10,980 --> 00:12:12,460
没错 他是你爸爸
That's right. He's your dad.

363
00:12:13,140 --> 00:12:14,620
你好 爸爸 你好 爸爸
Hi, dad. Hi, dad.

364
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:15,780
你可以的
You can do it.

365
00:12:15,980 --> 00:12:16,860
加油 叫爸爸
Come on, say, "Dad."

366
00:12:17,980 --> 00:12:18,860
叫呀
Come on.

367
00:12:19,900 --> 00:12:20,540
叫呀
Come on!

368
00:12:21,500 --> 00:12:21,940
安迪
Andy!

369
00:12:24,100 --> 00:12:25,560
索菲那边进展如何了
Hey. How'd it go with Sophie?

370
00:12:25,620 --> 00:12:27,920
我尽力了 但我觉得她还不能原谅对方
I did my best, but I don't think she's ready to forgive.

371
00:12:28,100 --> 00:12:28,980
该死
Oh, damn it.

372
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:30,660
是啊 我们完蛋了
I know. We're screwed.

373
00:12:30,800 --> 00:12:31,960
是啊 多亏了索菲的"贡献"
Yeah, thanks a lot, Sophie.

374
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:35,180
特蕾西确实有点过分了
Well, Tracy really was out of line.

375
00:12:35,540 --> 00:12:36,760
-怪她吗 -是啊
- Was she? - Yeah.

376
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:39,540
是索菲一如既往太小题大作了吧
Or was Sophie, per usual, being a big drama queen?

377
00:12:39,780 --> 00:12:40,600
小题大作吗
Drama queen?

378
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:42,200
不 特蕾西还散播谣言
No, Tracy was spreading rumors

379
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,860
说索菲的男友还和玛雅在一起
that Sophie's boyfriend was still into Maya.

380
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,000
那不是谣言
They weren't rumors.

381
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:46,720
她直接从别人那里听说的
She heard it directly from someone

382
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:49,600
那人看到玛雅和罗德尼在码头手牵手
who saw Maya and Rodney holding hands at the pier.

383
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:52,002
小卡 谁看见的啊 是黛娜
Cam, who? Dana!

384
00:12:52,424 --> 00:12:54,002
她的话可信吗
Yeah, like she can be trusted.

385
00:12:54,463 --> 00:12:56,287
简直是艾登事件重演
This is Aidan all over again.

386
00:12:57,140 --> 00:12:58,860
米奇尔 是特蕾西的短信
Mitchell, it's from Tracy.

387
00:12:58,860 --> 00:13:00,060
塔克老师 谢谢你
"Mr.Tucker, thank you.

388
00:13:00,060 --> 00:13:01,493
我和索菲谈过了
"Talked to Sophie.

389
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,380
我们还是会一起办派对
Party's back on."

390
00:13:03,460 --> 00:13:04,100
你不是开玩笑吧
Are you kidding me?

391
00:13:04,100 --> 00:13:06,200
天呐 你真是个天才
Oh, my gosh, you're an evil genius!

392
00:13:06,460 --> 00:13:07,300
你才是 知道吗
You are! You know what?

393
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:10,000
我觉得特蕾西敢于认错真的很棒 真的
I give Tracy a lot of credit for admitting she was wrong. I do.

394
00:13:10,009 --> 00:13:11,808
是啊 即使错的是索菲
Yeah, even though it was Sophie's fault.

395
00:13:12,759 --> 00:13:14,671
-不 -怎么了
- No! - Hmm? What?

396
00:13:14,680 --> 00:13:16,420
他们还要用我们的会场
They're still using our venue!

397
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:18,220
不 没搞错吧
No! Are you kidding me?!

398
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:21,460
-太糟糕了 -真的吗
- This is so frustrating! - Really?

399
00:13:21,460 --> 00:13:22,420
你确定你真是这么想的吗
Are you sure that's how you feel,

400
00:13:22,420 --> 00:13:24,240
还是再给你点时间好好想想
or do you need a little more time to think about it?

401
00:13:25,300 --> 00:13:26,640
貌似你有话想说
Sounds like you're trying to make a point there.

402
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,620
我真惊讶你这么快就反应过来了
Wow, I'm surprised you picked up on that so quick.

403
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:30,440
是啊 你肯定是在暗示什么
Yeah, you're definitely dancing around something.

404
00:13:30,540 --> 00:13:31,860
我觉得跟速度有关
I feel like it's speed-related.

405
00:13:31,975 --> 00:13:34,260
我们没能订上马车房就是因为
Yeah, we lost the carriage house because you,

406
00:13:34,260 --> 00:13:34,620
你一如既往地
true to form,

407
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:36,220
不能及时做出决定
couldn't make a timely decision.

408
00:13:36,220 --> 00:13:38,220
我们只是出去讨论了两秒钟
We were out of the room for two second--

409
00:13:38,220 --> 00:13:39,680
"一如既往"是什么意思
What is this "True to form" business?

410
00:13:39,820 --> 00:13:40,620
里奇戴尔路28号院
28 Richdale Road.

411
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:42,280
天呐 你在跟我开玩笑吗
Oh, my god, are you kidding me?

412
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,960
你在我们的梦想家园面前犹犹豫豫
You hemmed and hawed over our dream house,

413
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:46,260
现在别人正在属于我们的角落里吃早饭
and now somebody else is eating breakfast in our nook!

414
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:47,380
我需要一个周末来考虑一下
I needed the weekend!

415
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:48,800
我从没想像过自己住在牧场
I never saw myself in a ranch!

416
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:49,700
那拉斯维加斯那次呢
And what about Las Vegas

417
00:13:49,740 --> 00:13:51,400
你无法决定要不要去看表演
when you couldn't quite commit to the show?

418
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:53,207
不不 别提那件事
No. No, no, don't.

419
00:13:53,207 --> 00:13:54,440
不不 没关系啊
No, no, no, it's fine.

420
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:55,409
我们可以下次再看
We'll see them next time,

421
00:13:55,409 --> 00:13:57,762
等那只白虎不咬罗伊的时候就去看
just as soon as that tiger un-eats Roy.

422
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:07,580
我喜欢那个标志
I love the sign!

423
00:14:07,580 --> 00:14:09,468
我不太确定
Uh, I'm not sure.

424
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:11,620
一开始我觉得用一点鲜艳的颜色
First, I thought just a little accent of color

425
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:14,260
就可以了 可现在我在考虑加上气球
was all it needed, but now I'm thinking balloons.

426
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:16,360
杰 你更喜欢哪个
Jay, what do you like better--

427
00:14:16,500 --> 00:14:17,700
色彩[口音]还是气"球"
the accent or the balloons?

428
00:14:17,820 --> 00:14:19,960
遇见你之后 我一直在问自己这问题
I've been asking myself that since I met you.

429
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:21,820
我可以这么说吗
Can I just say,

430
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:24,220
我希望自己的恋爱中也有这样风趣的调侃
I want this type of playful banter in my relationship.

431
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:26,600
去别处说去
As long as you say it someplace else.

432
00:14:27,660 --> 00:14:28,100
真好笑
Good one.

433
00:14:28,580 --> 00:14:30,440
你在干什么 他们马上就到了
What are you doing? They're gonna be here any moment.

434
00:14:30,620 --> 00:14:32,380
我在看曼尼的班级纪念册
I've been combing through Manny's yearbook.

435
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:34,540
我发现了几个他可能有机会钓到的女孩
I found a few girls he might have a shot with.

436
00:14:34,540 --> 00:14:36,680
你知道丽莎·内格尔脖子以下长什么样吗
Happen to know what Lisa Nagel's like from the neck down?

437
00:14:36,980 --> 00:14:38,920
我没跟他讲你要我说的话
I didn't tell him what you told me to say.

438
00:14:39,020 --> 00:14:40,020
什么 为什么啊
What? Why?

439
00:14:40,300 --> 00:14:43,520
因为他告诉了我艾米来了以后他的打算
Because he told me what he's going to do when Amy comes here,

440
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:44,640
是个很浪漫的计划
and it's beautiful.

441
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:47,540
我觉得他成功的机会比你想的要大
I think he has a better chance than you think.

442
00:14:47,660 --> 00:14:48,960
他知道怎么跟女孩子说话
He knows how to talk to girls.

443
00:14:48,980 --> 00:14:50,500
他只知道怎么跟一个女孩子说话
He knows how to talk to a girl

444
00:14:50,680 --> 00:14:51,080
就是你
-- you.

445
00:14:51,260 --> 00:14:53,240
我希望你有他的心脏的近照
I hope you have a recent picture of his heart.

446
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:55,840
这样碎了以后可以照着拼回去
You're gonna need it putting the pieces back together.

447
00:14:56,460 --> 00:14:58,800
我来开
I'll get it!

448
00:14:59,580 --> 00:15:00,540
你好 曼小尼
Hey, Mandrake.

449
00:15:01,158 --> 00:15:03,260
菲尔 我听说了你被抓的事
Hi, Phil. I heard about jail.

450
00:15:03,260 --> 00:15:05,640
-你还好吗 -挺不容易的
- How are you doing? - It was rough.

451
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:07,040
在那个冰冷的笼子里
Stayed in that cold cell

452
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:09,340
等了太久 因为我可爱的...
a lot longer than I needed to thanks to my lovely --

453
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,660
你的助记法太扯了 菲尔
Your system is ridiculous, Phil.

454
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:12,780
其实很简单
Quite simple, actually!

455
00:15:13,046 --> 00:15:14,228
"钱袋"跟"脑袋"发音很像
"Cheddah" rhymes with "Hedda."

456
00:15:14,228 --> 00:15:16,071
你脑袋枕在什么上边 枕头啊
Where do you rest your head on? Your pilla!

457
00:15:16,071 --> 00:15:18,829
-不是吗 哥们 -我没有哥们
- Help me out, buddy. - I have no buddy.

458
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:19,800
可是 卢克
But... Luke?

459
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,800
我来开
I'll get it!

460
00:15:25,460 --> 00:15:27,080
你别再想了好不好
Would you please just let it go?

461
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:28,260
我早就不想了
I did let it go immediately.

462
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:29,340
你才是那个纠结的人
You're the one who hesitated,

463
00:15:29,340 --> 00:15:30,520
你对待任何事都是这样
like you do with everything.

464
00:15:30,860 --> 00:15:32,700
已经说了一路了
The whole way here.

465
00:15:34,098 --> 00:15:35,260
爸 在你发火之前 我...
Dad, before you get mad, I'm --

466
00:15:35,260 --> 00:15:37,940
"我发火之前"是在几小时之前
Oh, we passed "Before I get mad" hours ago

467
00:15:37,940 --> 00:15:40,240
当我因为你被关单人禁闭的时候
when I was sitting in solitary for your crime!

468
00:15:40,420 --> 00:15:42,780
因为里面没有其他人所以才说单人禁闭
It was only solitary because no one else was in there.

469
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:44,760
你给海莉钱让她陪我练车
You paid Haley to take me driving?

470
00:15:44,910 --> 00:15:46,060
是的
Uh -- that's right.

471
00:15:46,060 --> 00:15:47,340
海莉都告诉我了
Haley told me everything!

472
00:15:47,340 --> 00:15:48,733
你编造了一个工会
You made up a fake union

473
00:15:48,733 --> 00:15:50,080
就为了不来陪我吗
just so you wouldn't have to be with me?!

474
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,520
艾丽克斯 对不起
Alex, I am so sorry.

475
00:15:51,740 --> 00:15:52,720
海莉 我那么信任你
Haley, I trusted you.

476
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:54,920
信任这个家里的人没有好下场
Good luck trusting anyone in this family,

477
00:15:55,140 --> 00:15:56,160
尤其是爸爸
especially dad.

478
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:58,880
通常我带你去参加你原本不愿去的活动时
Usually when I drag you kicking and screaming to something,

479
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,140
过后你都会感谢我
you thank me afterwards.

480
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:01,400
这次我错了
This time, I was wrong.

481
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:02,460
他做了什么
What did he do?

482
00:16:02,640 --> 00:16:04,280
他骗我去上舞蹈课
He lied me into a dance class.

483
00:16:04,340 --> 00:16:05,780
卢克 对不起
Luke, I am so sorry.

484
00:16:06,020 --> 00:16:08,100
海莉 你有大麻烦了
Haley, you are in so much trouble!

485
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,240
超大麻烦
So much trouble!

486
00:16:09,260 --> 00:16:10,840
别把这事说成她的错
Stop trying to make this her fault!

487
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,780
什么样的父母会骗他们的小孩
What kind of parents lie to their kids?!

488
00:16:12,900 --> 00:16:14,900
就是 这又是什么教育方式
Yeah, what kind of lesson is that to teach all of this?

489
00:16:14,900 --> 00:16:15,880
我说认真的 有些时候我想
Yeah, seriously, sometimes I want --

490
00:16:15,880 --> 00:16:18,420
你们都不知道事情的真相
Hey, neither one of you knows the whole story.

491
00:16:18,602 --> 00:16:19,825
拜托
Ah, please.

492
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:21,960
让我告诉他们事实
Let me tell them the truth.

493
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:24,000
艾丽克斯
Alex, the real reason

494
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,220
妈妈不想教你开车的真正原因
mom doesn't want to teach you to drive

495
00:16:25,220 --> 00:16:27,000
是因为她不希望你拿到驾照
is because she doesn't want you getting your license.

496
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:29,280
-什么 -仔细想想
- What? - Think about it.

497
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:32,120
开车载你是妈妈最喜欢的和你共处的时间
Mom driving you around is kind of her favorite time with you.

498
00:16:32,140 --> 00:16:34,640
这是唯一你不在埋头看书
It's the only place where your nose isn't buried in a book

499
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:36,560
而她可以跟你说上话的地方
and she can actually talk to you.

500
00:16:37,260 --> 00:16:38,660
你拿到的是驾照
Sure, you're getting your license,

501
00:16:38,680 --> 00:16:40,700
她失去的却是女儿
but she's losing her little girl.

502
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:41,960
妈 这是真的吗
Mom, is that true?

503
00:16:42,740 --> 00:16:43,660
过来
Come here.

504
00:16:44,520 --> 00:16:47,040
爸爸对你撒谎的唯一原因是
And the only reason dad lied to you is...

505
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:49,520
我能告诉他吗 爸
Should I tell him, dad?

506
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:51,420
说吧
Fine.

507
00:16:53,140 --> 00:16:54,820
爸爸在大学里是个超级书呆子
Dad was a huge nerd in college.

508
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:58,340
他约了妈妈快十次都被拒绝了
He asked mom out like 10 times, and she always said no.

509
00:16:58,520 --> 00:17:01,140
最终 他说 只要你做一件事
Finally, he said, "I'll never bug you again

510
00:17:01,140 --> 00:17:02,920
-我就再也不烦你了 -只要一件事
- if you do one thing." - Just one.

511
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:04,480
-和我跳舞 -只是跳舞
- "Dance with me." - Just dance.

512
00:17:04,860 --> 00:17:06,480
他抱着她在舞池旋转
He spun her around on the floor

513
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:08,420
用肢体语言表达他无法
and expressed himself with his body

514
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:11,040
-说出口的情感 -很美好
- in a way he never could with words. - That's beautiful.

515
00:17:11,740 --> 00:17:12,900
妈妈才终于看到了
Mom finally saw the dad

516
00:17:12,900 --> 00:17:14,315
我们深爱的这个爸爸的优点
that we all know and love.

517
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,700
所以你想教会我这招
And you wanted to give that to me?

518
00:17:16,980 --> 00:17:17,980
过来
Come here.

519
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:22,640
大家过来吃蛋糕啦
Everybody, come for cake!

520
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:25,360
我们可以晚点再讨论对我的惩罚
We can discuss my punishment later.

521
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:28,180
她是跟我们学的吗
Did she learn that from us?

522
00:17:28,683 --> 00:17:31,422
那个可学不会 是天份
That can't be taught. It is a gift.

523
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:33,520
她还是那样
Yeah, she's still doing it,

524
00:17:33,520 --> 00:17:34,980
眼泛桃花地跟着我
following me around all moony-eyed.

525
00:17:35,140 --> 00:17:36,300
她怎么就不明白我的意思呢
She just won't get the message.

526
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:38,420
不过好消息是 艾米马上就过来了
But on the bright side, Amy's on her way over.

527
00:17:38,700 --> 00:17:39,520
我们得谈谈
We need to talk.

528
00:17:39,736 --> 00:17:41,132
我得挂了 罗本
Got to go, Reuben.

529
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:43,740
-什么事 -关于你的感情生活
- What's up? - It's about your love life.

530
00:17:43,860 --> 00:17:44,900
有好多人在呢 杰
A lot of people here, Jay.

531
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:46,340
这是我正式对你进行介入指导
Consider it an intervention.

532
00:17:46,844 --> 00:17:49,356
这个艾米的事有点不太靠谱
Now, this whole Amy thing is going nowhere,

533
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:52,200
不过听起来有另外一个女孩很喜欢你
but it sounds like you have a girl that really likes you.

534
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:54,360
我知道这可能不是你最想要的
Now, I know it's not everything you want.

535
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:56,070
可能她体态有点偏胖
M-maybe she's a little thick in the middle.

536
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:56,980
我也不知道
I don't know.

537
00:17:57,520 --> 00:17:59,100
可是你何不给她一个机会呢
But why don't you give her a try?

538
00:17:59,940 --> 00:18:01,620
所以你觉得我应该选择那个女生吗
So you think that's the girl I should go for?

539
00:18:01,660 --> 00:18:03,180
很明显她超喜欢你
She's obviously crazy about you.

540
00:18:03,180 --> 00:18:05,060
你了解她别的方面吗
I mean, what else do you even know about her?

541
00:18:05,360 --> 00:18:06,420
你好啊曼尼
Hi, Manny.

542
00:18:07,627 --> 00:18:09,960
她只有六岁而且跟我有血缘关系
Well, she's 6 and related to me.

543
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:10,580
我还需要继续说吗
Shall I go on?

544
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:12,240
这倒是解释了今早她为什么
Okay, that explains all the outfits

545
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,140
那么在意自己穿什么
she rejected this morning.

546
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:14,180
我的观点还是没变
The point remains.

547
00:18:14,180 --> 00:18:15,940
你应该把眼光放低一些
You could lower your sights a little.

548
00:18:16,060 --> 00:18:17,360
好吧 还是要继续这个话题
Good, we're still talking about this.

549
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:19,040
放过他吧
Ay, leave him alone.

550
00:18:19,040 --> 00:18:21,940
艾米来了一定会喜欢她外套里的惊喜的
When Amy comes, she's going to love her coat surprise.

551
00:18:22,100 --> 00:18:22,620
艾米是谁
Who's Amy?

552
00:18:22,900 --> 00:18:24,440
就是杰认为对我没兴趣的那个女生
This girl Jay doesn't think is into me,

553
00:18:24,560 --> 00:18:25,660
但是她把外套留在这里了
but she left her coat here.

554
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:26,840
她这么做还有什么别的原因
Why else would a person do that?

555
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:28,780
这么说的话我爱死丹尼斯餐厅了
By that logic, I love Denny's.

556
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,840
即使她现在不喜欢我
Even if she's not into me right away,

557
00:18:31,020 --> 00:18:32,900
难道以后就没有可能日久生情吗
isn't it possible she could fall for me over time?

558
00:18:33,060 --> 00:18:34,680
没有 有种东西叫化学反应
No, there's a thing called chemistry.

559
00:18:34,940 --> 00:18:36,100
真有感觉的话一下就知道了
People know right away.

560
00:18:36,460 --> 00:18:37,000
也不一定
Not necessarily.

561
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:40,240
我当时也不知道自己会喜欢你
I didn't know immediately that I liked you.

562
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:41,700
当然也许不是在一开始就知道
Well, maybe not the first minute.

563
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:42,600
用了一个月吧
One month.

564
00:18:42,820 --> 00:18:43,900
一个月 天哪
A month? Yikes.

565
00:18:44,180 --> 00:18:44,960
我支持曼尼
I'm with Manny.

566
00:18:45,300 --> 00:18:46,800
有些人会相信自己的直觉
Some people can trust their instincts

567
00:18:46,800 --> 00:18:48,140
然后全身心地投入
and leap in with both feet.

568
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:49,840
但有些人则需要慢慢来
Others need to take their time.

569
00:18:49,940 --> 00:18:51,640
好吧 小卡想说的是
Okay, what Cam is so subtly implying

570
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:53,280
他在一开始就知道要和我在一起
is that he knew instantly with me

571
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:55,180
但我就像往常一样需要时间做决定
while I, as usual, took my sweet time.

572
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:55,940
但你知道吗
Well, guess what.

573
00:18:56,040 --> 00:18:57,360
其实我从第一眼就认定你了
I knew instantly with you.

574
00:18:57,380 --> 00:18:58,180
怎么样
How about that?

575
00:18:58,471 --> 00:19:00,523
-事实上是我没有 -好吧
- Actually, I didn't. - Okay, well, yes,

576
00:19:00,523 --> 00:19:02,528
如果算上那次糟糕的早午餐
if you count that one disastrous brunch, then --

577
00:19:02,540 --> 00:19:03,680
-两个月吧 -两个月
- two months. - Two months?!

578
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:04,756
-是啊 -天哪
- Mm-hmm. - Yikes!

579
00:19:04,756 --> 00:19:06,129
我站在杰这边
Well, I'm in the Jay camp.

580
00:19:06,129 --> 00:19:08,240
当你遇到了对的人 一下就知道
When you meet the right person, bang!

581
00:19:08,260 --> 00:19:10,832
我就是这种 多久
That's what happened with -- How long?

582
00:19:11,262 --> 00:19:12,420
六个月
Uh...six months?

583
00:19:12,420 --> 00:19:13,540
六个月 天哪
Six months -- Yikes.

584
00:19:13,562 --> 00:19:17,387
但你那时候都怀...跟我订婚了
But you were preg-- tically engaged to me by then.

585
00:19:17,387 --> 00:19:19,029
转得漂亮 爸爸
Mm, nice save, dad.

586
00:19:19,040 --> 00:19:19,600
等等
Wait a minute.

587
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:20,960
我以为他邀请你跳舞以后
I thought you fell in love with him

588
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:21,980
你就爱上他了呢
after he danced with you.

589
00:19:22,020 --> 00:19:23,320
那就是六个月的时候啊
And that was six months in.

590
00:19:23,940 --> 00:19:25,840
你为什么等那么久才邀请我跳舞 菲尔
Why did it take you so long to dance with me, Phil?

591
00:19:25,980 --> 00:19:26,580
我也不知道 克莱尔
I don't know, Claire.

592
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:27,980
按理说我早该那么做了
You'd think I would've gotten to it by then

593
00:19:27,980 --> 00:19:28,860
因为我们那时都同居了
since we lived together.

594
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:32,480
对不起 我一直在抱怨你拖慢了进度
I'm sorry. I've been berating you about dragging your feet, and,

595
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:33,597
但在我们之间的事上
and when it comes to us,

596
00:19:33,597 --> 00:19:34,953
我才是更犹豫不决的人
I'm even more hesitate-y than --

597
00:19:34,953 --> 00:19:35,880
不不 这是好事
No, no, this is great because

598
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:37,180
这就是说我们的纪念日
that makes our real anniversary

599
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:38,860
其实比原本以为的要晚两个月
two months later when we were both sure.

600
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:41,020
我们还是可以在马车房举行婚礼
We can still book the carriage house for our wedding.

601
00:19:41,020 --> 00:19:42,060
天哪 你是在给他们打电话吗
Oh, my gosh, are you calling them?

602
00:19:42,060 --> 00:19:43,259
-是的 -太好了
- Yes! - Yes!

603
00:19:43,259 --> 00:19:44,234
不过 我
Although, I-I am --

604
00:19:44,234 --> 00:19:45,443
-打给他们 -好的
- Call them. - Okay.

605
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:48,920
所以你那时其实一直跟这个家伙同居
So, you were living with this guy the whole time...

606
00:19:49,071 --> 00:19:50,991
-杰 -多可爱
- Jay! - Aww, how cute!

607
00:19:51,002 --> 00:19:52,340
他想吃蛋糕
He wants cake!

608
00:19:52,340 --> 00:19:53,620
不 不 认真听
No, no, listen, listen, listen!

609
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:54,140
他在说什么
What's he saying?

610
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:56,400
-杰 -杰
- Jay. - Jay!

611
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:57,920
他在说"杰"
He's saying, "Jay"!

612
00:19:58,220 --> 00:19:59,620
他认识我
He knows me!

613
00:19:59,720 --> 00:20:02,080
"杰"这个字比"爸爸"要难说
And that "J" word, that's harder to say than "Dada"!

614
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:04,420
他真是个天才 过来
He's a genius. Come here.

615
00:20:08,020 --> 00:20:09,060
她来了
She's here!

616
00:20:10,060 --> 00:20:11,432
时机到了 曼尼
This is it, Manny!

617
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:12,300
把她拿下 伙计
Go get her, buddy!

618
00:20:12,474 --> 00:20:14,265
听着 孩子
Hey, hey, hey, listen, kid.

619
00:20:14,663 --> 00:20:16,180
你之前说有些人需要时间
Y-you might've been right about some people

620
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:18,020
才能缓过神来也许是对的
needing a little more time before they come around.

621
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:19,480
你看这小宝贝就是这样的
I mean, look at peanut here.

622
00:20:20,500 --> 00:20:21,140
祝你好运 曼尼
Good luck, Manny.

623
00:20:21,900 --> 00:20:22,520
谢了 杰
Thanks, Jay.

624
00:20:23,840 --> 00:20:25,580
你用了六个月才成功是吧 菲尔
So, it took you six months, huh, Phil?

625
00:20:26,780 --> 00:20:27,920
我能接受六个月
I can do six months.

626
00:20:29,020 --> 00:20:30,740
我会等你的
I'll be here!

627
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:32,560
我不喜欢这种感觉
I'm not loving this.

628
00:20:42,720 --> 00:20:44,820
他的门还是关着
His door is still closed.

629
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:45,540
他在里面干什么
What is he doing in there?

630
00:20:45,660 --> 00:20:47,340
我觉得我们都清楚他在里面干什么
I think we both know what he's doing in there.

631
00:20:47,540 --> 00:20:48,660
他都弄了几个小时了
He's been at it for hours.

632
00:20:48,840 --> 00:20:50,160
我年轻的时候也是这样
That's how I was at his age.

633
00:20:50,160 --> 00:20:51,760
他会虚脱的
He's gonna wear himself out.

634
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:52,700
你应该跟他谈谈
You should talk to him.

635
00:20:52,780 --> 00:20:54,120
我不想让他难为情
I don't want to embarrass him.

636
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:56,540
-那就先敲门 -你说得对
- So, knock first. - Maybe you're right.

637
00:20:56,800 --> 00:20:58,440
我怕他做得方式不对 把自己弄伤
I don't want him doing it wrong and getting hurt.

638
00:20:58,440 --> 00:20:59,400
卢克
Luke?

639
00:21:00,620 --> 00:21:02,040
我进来了
I'm coming in.

640
00:21:03,420 --> 00:21:05,260
伙计 兄弟
Hey, man. Buddy!

641
00:21:06,020 --> 00:21:07,400
爸爸 快出去
Dad?! Get out of here!

642
00:21:07,500 --> 00:21:09,720
别难为情儿子 这很正常
Don't be embarrassed, son. It's perfectly natural!

643
00:21:09,740 --> 00:21:10,560
出去
Get out!
